MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 221192851}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf1cef0141ffd3544b44df369bba6075, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MapManager
  dinosaurButton: {fileID: 875063933}
  planeButton: {fileID: 925892636}
  pyramidButton: {fileID: 1327460060}
  greeceButton: {fileID: 540995481}
  japanButton: {fileID: 1936175301}
  carButton: {fileID: 1075627244}
  phoneButton: {fileID: 1356538668}
  infoPanelController: {fileID: 1313141125}
  dinosaurImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0c95fe3c04607dc4a8caa4f47f83faad, type: 3}
  dinosaurTitle: Dinosaur
  dinosaurText: Dinosaurs ruled the Earth for over 160 million years, evolving from
    small creatures into the diverse giants of the Triassic, Jurassic, and Cretaceous
    periods. Now you can watch the magic dinosaur bones turn into flesh within seconds
    as you step back in time to meet the giants that once ruled our planet. Feel
    free to explore the dinosaur terrain and use the fossil brush to uncover your
    hidden fossils!
  planeImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ea8dea8db253a76408d3c69f2bfd8d8c, type: 3}
  planeTitle: Plane
  planeText: "The incredible story of flight, from fragile wood-and-fabric gliders
    to the powerful jets that soar across the globe today. Watch how shaky propellers
    evolved into sleek, high-speed machines that conquered the skies and brought
    the world closer together. By following this journey into the clouds, you\u2019ll
    unlock the history of how humans turned a dream into reality\u2014feel free to
    try out our newly installed flight simulator to see these famous wings in action!"
  pyramidImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b574e998b5b3fd43a0bdadcaaf47091, type: 3}
  pyramidTitle: Pyramid
  pyramidText: Discover the wonders of the Great Pyramid, a massive stone tomb built
    by ancient builders to honor their kings and prepare them for the journey beyond.
    Explore the mysterious halls and solve the puzzles to unlock a secret path that
    leads even deeper into the heart of the pyramid.
  greeceImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 608a110a6f2ee364ab80181128d77e75, type: 3}
  greeceTitle: Greece
  greeceText: Step into the heart of Ancient Greece, where sun-bleached marble temples
    stand as timeless monuments to gods and heroes. Wander through the soaring columns
    of the Parthenon and discover breathtaking sculptures that bring myths to life
    with stunning detail.
  japanImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1ed9cbeb3ccac874a972dec54ea31b32, type: 3}
  japanTitle: Japan
  japanText: 'Step into the heart of old Japan, a world of mist-covered mountains
    and quiet, historic paths. Walk through the soaring, tiered pagodas built to
    reach toward the heavens and explore the delicate beauty of the traditional tea
    ceremony. '
  carImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3a8061cbf8810cb4283737496611f487, type: 3}
  carTitle: Car
  carText: "The exciting story of the car, from noisy \"horseless carriages\" made
    of wood to the smart, silent electric vehicles of today. See how travel changed
    as simple engines and hand-cranks turned into sleek, fast machines that gave
    everyone the freedom to explore the open road. By following the path of these
    changing wheels, you\u2019ll unlock the history of how we moved from slow bumpy
    trails to a world where any destination is just a drive away."
  phoneImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa58f93a35c506449a79469cd14be8dc, type: 3}
  phoneTitle: Phone
  phoneText: "Trace the amazing journey of the phone, from heavy boxes on the wall
    to the thin glass screens we carry today. Watch how communication changed as
    \"brick\" phones with long antennas turned into cool flip phones, and finally
    into tiny pocket computers that keep us connected to everyone, everywhere. By
    looking at how these gadgets changed, you\u2019ll see the story of how we found
    faster and easier ways to talk, share, and stay close to the people who matter
    most."
