  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoStandTrigger
  title: Pyramid
  body: 'This is the pyramid era, where we are displaying a sphinx and also a few
    pyramids. We also have a underground basement for you to visit. To see the underground
    please solve the puzzle and the trap door on the floor opens. Remember white
    tablet stands give you information about an era, and blue info icons give specific
    activity information! Enjoy! '
